Since 3.4.1, a secondary weapon getting cursed has caused it to be
dropped. However, a check was omitted for the cursing part of the
bones-leaving process; as a result, the game could try to drop the
weapon from your inventory after you were dead. As it had already by
this point been removed from your inventory to create the bones pile,
this caused Problems. Since 3.4.2, it's now the case that
secondary-weapon status is cleared before the bones-cursing happens,
in order to circumvent this.

